{
  "sn6.10:0.1": "Linked Discourses 6.10 ",
  "sn6.10:0.2": "1. The Appeal ",
  "sn6.10:0.3": "With Kokālika ",
  "sn6.10:1.1": "At Sāvatthī. ",
  "sn6.10:1.2": "Then the mendicant Kokālika went up to the Buddha, bowed, sat down to one side, and said to him, ",
  "sn6.10:1.3": "“Sir, Sāriputta and Moggallāna have corrupt wishes. They’ve fallen under the sway of corrupt wishes.” ",
  "sn6.10:1.4": "When this was said, the Buddha said to Kokālika, ",
  "sn6.10:1.5": "“Don’t say that, Kokālika! Don’t say that, Kokālika! ",
  "sn6.10:1.6": "Have confidence in Sāriputta and Moggallāna, they’re good monks.” ",
  "sn6.10:1.7": "For a second time Kokālika said to the Buddha, ",
  "sn6.10:1.8": "“Despite my faith and trust in the Buddha, Sāriputta and Moggallāna have corrupt wishes. They’ve fallen under the sway of corrupt wishes.” ",
  "sn6.10:1.9": "For a second time, the Buddha said to Kokālika, ",
  "sn6.10:1.10": "“Don’t say that, Kokālika! Don’t say that, Kokālika! ",
  "sn6.10:1.11": "Have confidence in Sāriputta and Moggallāna, they’re good monks.” ",
  "sn6.10:1.12": "For a third time Kokālika said to the Buddha, ",
  "sn6.10:1.13": "“Despite my faith and trust in the Buddha, Sāriputta and Moggallāna have corrupt wishes. They’ve fallen under the sway of corrupt wishes.” ",
  "sn6.10:1.14": "For a third time, the Buddha said to Kokālika, ",
  "sn6.10:1.15": "“Don’t say that, Kokālika! Don’t say that, Kokālika! ",
